<title>CANADA: Acklands says president, COO resigns.</title>
<headline>Acklands says president, COO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acklands Ltd said on Wednesday that James Williams resigned as president and chief operating officer, but would serve as a consultant to the company.</p>
<p>Acklands said the company had changed a great deal with the sale of its industrial group and the ongoing evaluation of its remaining businesses.</p>
<p>&quot;Consequently, Mr. Williams felt the timing was appropriate for him to pursue other opportunities,&quot; Acklands said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
